{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "release",
  "description": "An approver releases the reviewed assessment Payments 2026 Q4: with MFA step-up (start review), with the password of a local user (start password), or after someone saved since the review (start changed); the step-up can also be refused because too many logins are pending (state too-many-logins).",
  "user": {
    "pseudonym": "p-7d2e58",
    "name": "Noor Haddad",
    "groups": [
      "samm-approvers",
      "isms-readers"
    ]
  },
  "rights": [
